      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cg",
      "action": "hide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "營裡的手電筒快沒電了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你放心吧，家綸他沒事的，我一個人去找他就好了。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "不，我也要去。",
      "expr": "04-tears"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "現在這麼晚了，外頭很危險，你還是留在這兒。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "不，我要跟你一起去。",
      "expr": "01-smile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "那好吧，就一起走好了。那我們出去了啦。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "布簾一翻。獵戶座在上面。洗手間裡沒有家綸。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你那邊也沒有看到他吧？",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "沒有啊。究竟他到那裡去了？我們剛才大叫了好幾聲，也沒有回應。我怕他走到下午去過的石灘。",
      "expr": "02-sigh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "這個嘛……",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "嗨！凌晨！素婷！你們找到家綸那小子沒有？",
      "expr": "04-gasp"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "還沒有。我們打算到石灘去看看。",
      "expr": "03-worry"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "犯不著走到那麼遠吧？他人這麼大，自己懂得回去。這兒這麼冷，回營裡等他吧。",
      "expr": "01-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "dabi",
      "text": "對了，這裡又很安全。",
      "expr": "04-snort"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "dabi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "找了這麼久也找不著，也不要緊嗎？",
      "expr": "05-spring"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "dabi",
      "text": "不要緊。",
      "expr": "01-hum"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "dabi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "對了對了，先回營裡再說吧。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "那好吧。",
      "expr": "04-tears"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "她只是勉強答應。電話響了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch11-phone"
    }
  ]
}
